Full text of the Apache License 2.0:
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0


## 2. Core LVS Prototype Source Code

The TypeScript implementation in `src/` (LVS core prototype, consensus logic,
value / trust updates and related system-level code) **is NOT open-sourced
under Apache 2.0 or MIT**.

All protocol-level technology in this repository is protected under the
**“LVS Core Technology License”**, which prohibits:

- redistribution of the core source code;
- modification and redistribution of derivative works;
- commercial use, production deployments or mainnet launches;
- offering this code as a hosted or commercial service;

unless you obtain an explicit written permission from the LVS project owner.

This repository is provided for **private review, research and evaluation only**.
Unauthorized publication, cloning or reverse-engineering of the LVS protocol
for competing networks is strictly prohibited.


## 3. Contributions

External contributions (pull requests, patches, forks) are currently **not**
accepted into the core protocol. Any contribution that is merged in the future
will be governed by a separate written agreement with the LVS project owner.


